{"id":142,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Aerodactyl’s sawlike fangs can shred skin to tatters—even the skin of Steel-type Pokémon."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This is a ferocious Pokémon from ancient times. Apparently even modern technology is incapable of producing a perfectly restored specimen."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"A savage Pokémon that died out in ancient times. It was resurrected using DNA taken from amber."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It flew through the open skies over the ancient continent as if they were its own. When it touched ground, its walk was weak and slow."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Restored from DNA found in amber, this Pokémon exhibited ferocity that was greater than expected. Some casualties resulted."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"In ancient times, it ruled the skies. A widely accepted theory is that it went extinct due to a large meteor impact."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"A Pokémon from the age of the dinosaurs. It used its sawlike fangs to shred its prey before eating them."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Aerodactyl is a Pokémon from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from genetic material extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies in ancient times."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"This vicious Pokémon is said to have flown in ancient skies while shrieking high-pitched cries."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It was regenerated from a dinosaur’s genetic matter that was found in amber. It flies with high-pitched cries."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"A vicious Pokémon from the distant past, it appears to have flown by spreading its wings and gliding."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"A ferocious, prehistoric PO